LHC-Forms (lforms) 44.0.0
https://lhncbc.github.io/lforms/
Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/lforms/-/lforms-44.0.0.tgz
Licence: see https://github.com/lhncbc/lforms (U.S. National Library of Medicine)

Vendored rather than loaded from a CDN because the deployment server may have no
outbound internet. Loaded lazily by bkm-web/js/lforms-loader.js, not from
index.html, because the bundle is ~3.8MB.

Files taken from the package, and where they came from inside it:

  lhc-forms.js        dist/lforms/webcomponent/lhc-forms.js
  styles.css          dist/lforms/webcomponent/styles.css
  zone.min.js         dist/lforms/webcomponent/assets/lib/zone.min.js
  lformsFHIR.min.js   dist/lforms/fhir/R4/lformsFHIR.min.js      (R4 only - HAPI is R4)
  *.png               dist/lforms/webcomponent/                  (referenced by styles.css)

TO UPDATE
  npm pack lforms@<version>   # or curl the tarball from the registry
  tar -xzf lforms-<version>.tgz
  copy the five files above into this directory, keeping these names
  update this file, then: docker compose build bkm-web && docker compose up -d bkm-web
  finally re-run: make test-menus
